     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>I&#39;m trying to connect from R to <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792394556741000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RPghw68_OnBrfqbAqL29a\">shinyapps.io</a> behind a corporate firewall. I don&#39;t manage to authenticate my account via <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">rsconnect::setAccountInfo</font><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">.</span></font><div><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Without setting any environment variables, I get a time-out:</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rsconnect</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">setAccountInfo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;...&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> token</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;...&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> secret</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;...&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">type</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> msg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> asError </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Failed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> to connect to api</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shinyapps</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">io port </span><span style=\"color:#066\">443</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Timed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">After figuring out my proxy settings from the proxy configuration script, I have tried the following things:</span><br></div><div><ul><li><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">set <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">RCurlOptions</font>:<br></span></font></li></ul></div></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;line-height:19.04px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.0392157)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">&gt; options</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">RCurlOptions</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">proxy </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;http://my.proxy:my.port&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> rsconnect</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">::</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">setAccountInfo</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">name</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;...&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> token</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;...&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> secret</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;...&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><br><br><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Error in function (type, msg, asError = TRUE)  : </div><div>  Received HTTP code 407 from proxy after CONNECT<br><br>#same thing happens with the following settings:<br><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;line-height:19.04px\">&gt; options</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;line-height:19.04px\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;line-height:19.04px\">RCurlOptions</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;line-height:19.04px\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;line-height:19.04px\">=</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;line-height:19.04px\"> list</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,mo